-- --- grants ------------------------------------------------------------------
-- READ ONLY, and that is the design rather than an oversight. Administrative
-- divisions change by decree, not by a workspace deciding: the service role
-- may select them and nothing else, so a bug cannot rename a province for
-- every tenant at once. A real change arrives as the next increment, from the
-- generator, with the source re-pinned.
GRANT USAGE ON SCHEMA yucer_ref TO yucer_svc;
GRANT SELECT ON yucer_ref.admin_division TO yucer_svc;

